# Virtual copies.
variants.create = Itani khophi ya virtual…
variants.rename = Shandulani dzina ḽa khophi ya virtual…
variants.delete = Thuthani khophi ya virtual
variants.close = Valani tshinepe itshi na khophi dzatsho dza virtual ni sa athu zwi sudzulusa kana u zwi thutha.
variants.saved_hint = Khophi i thoma kha nzudzanyo yo vhulungwaho, kana kha tsha u thoma arali hu si na nzudzanyo. Vhulungani tshanduko dzi sa athu vhulungwaho u thoma.
variants.move_original = Sudzulusani tshinepe tsha u thoma uri khophi dzatsho dza virtual dzi sudzuluswe.
variants.protected_export = Nangani huṅwe hune ha yelwa hone. Zwine zwa bviswa kha gaḽari a zwi koni u dzhiela tsha u thoma kana faela dza nzudzanyo yatsho vhudzulo.
